{"id":"teil","lemma":"Teil","pos":"noun","rank":384,"glosses":["part, piece (a physical object which is used in a greater one, often in relation to inanimate objects)","thing (any object, not limited to those which are part of a greater object)","piece of clothing"],"ipa":"/taɪ̯l/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/67/De-Teil.ogg/De-Teil.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Teiles","plural":"Teile"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie sind ein Teil von uns.","en":"They're part of us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745576","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Du bist ein Teil von mir.","en":"You're a part of me.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Diesen Teil hasse ich am meisten.","en":"This is the part I hate the most.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"}]},{"text":"Der Teil ist gut.","en":"That part is good.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Das ist Teil meiner Arbeit.","en":"It's part of my job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567077","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"toil"}]}]}